        "text": "Iron Hand Gu is the step that hardens the hands before hand blade Gu sharpens the palm edges. Tie Dao Ku’s strikes with that pairing are strong, heavy, and sharp enough that Bai Ning Bing dodges rather than take them head on, even with ice muscles jade bones.",
